In Part 3, link every opinion to a reason.. Check your word count in the last

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
five minutes of writing.. In writing: plan first, draft second, edit last.. In

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Listening, answers follow the question order.. If you miss the big idea, do not

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
